OL,4,CChina issues Mount Fuji warning as     
OL,5,Cfamily of missing climber offers reward
OL,6,GThe Chinese embassy in Japan has       
OL,7,Gwarned its citizens against off-season 
OL,8,Gascents of Mount Fuji amid concerns    
OL,9,Gthat the hefty reward offered by a     
OL,10,Gmissing hiker's family could encourage 
OL,11,Gmore reckless climbing.                
OL,13,FChen Jie, 25, vanished on 8 November   
OL,14,Fon the mountain. His family is         
OL,15,Foffering 500,000 yuan ($75,000;        
OL,16,F#57,300) to anyone who finds him       
OL,17,Falive, and 100,000 yuan to anyone who  
OL,18,Frecovers his body, say Chinese and     
OL,19,FJapanese media reports.                
